// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Warzone Operative Oudot 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P3187836602" "Warzone Operative Oudot"
// ProfessionString :
"P2355971922" "Arachnos Warzone Operative"
// DescriptionString :
"P2154209460" "Operative Oudot coordinates villain activities in the Bloody Bay warzone. Speak with Operative Oudot if you are willing to help with Arachnos efforts in the area.<br><br><color red>All missions received from Operative Oudot will bring you into conflict with other players!</color>"
// HelloString :
"P408834498" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>You ready to do some dirty work, {VillainName}?</a>"
// HelloString :
"P217587749" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>Let's get busy, {VillainName}.</a>"
// HelloString :
"P3213789394" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>Let's see if you can handle this one.</a>"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P2180018681" "What are you looking at?"
// FirstVisitString :
"P1064015842" "You must be {VillainName} - another of Lord Recluse's 'destined ones', no doubt. Whatever. If you're here talking to me it means you're not scared to mix it up with Paragon City heroes while you help Arachnos achieve objectives here in Bloody Bay. I'll warn you now, the heroes out here are top-notch and will take you down if you turn your back for a second. If that scares you then maybe you'd best head back home to mama! Otherwise, step up to the plate."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P2023317198" "I got nothing more for, {VillainName}. Arachnos is pleased with your work."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P3920521029" "You're a bit too busy for what I've got for you."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P1628542374" "You've got to be at least Threat Level {Level} for this ride, {VillainName}."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P903469988" "Nice job surviving so far, {VillainName}! I'm going to need you to call in regularly."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P676836703" "Arachnos is pleased with your work, {VillainName}!"
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P61214806" "You have done well for Arachnos, {VillainName}, but maybe it's time for you to head over to Siren's Call."
// LocationString :
// IntroString :
"P817950550" "Bloody Bay is a contested territory in the Rogue Isles. Arachnos has interest in the meteors which have landed there, but unfortunately every other treasure-hunter has taken interest as well. If you're interested in doing some work for Arachnos in Bloody Baby, go speak with Warzone Operative Oudot. He can get you Science and Technology Enhancements."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P570747708" "Choose Warzone Operative Oudot"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P4275132649" "Paragon City sends her best and brightest heroes to do battle there as well, so watch your back."
// IntroduceOneContact :
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
// PVPPATROL :
// PVPMISSION1 :
"P4259122779" "Bomb base to debuff hero damage"
// PVPMISSION2 :
"P1542346459" "Kidnap officer to debuff hero resistance"
// PVPMISSION3 :
"P1285330847" "Destroy listening post to buff villain damage"
// PVPMISSION4 :
"P1435601356" "Steal technology to buff villain resistance"
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

